// Кемп: өөрчлөлтийн түүх, импорт, PII лог — S Project Prisma schema (хэсэг; ерөнхий дүрэм → _base.prisma)

enum CampAuditAction {
  CREATE
  UPDATE
  DEACTIVATE
  IMPORT
  /// v0.2.2 Блок 5 (20261017001)
  TERMINATE
  REHIRE
}

enum CampDataImportType {
  EMPLOYEES
  DEPARTMENTS
  /// v0.2.3 Блок D (20261019001)
  POSITIONS
  FORMER_EMPLOYEES
  BUILDING_TYPES
  BUILDINGS
  ROOMS
  ROOM_ALLOCATIONS
}

enum CampDataImportStatus {
  PREVIEW
  CONFIRMED
  CANCELLED
}

enum CampDataImportSource {
  XLSX
  GRID
}

// ── v0.2.0 §0.4 — Кемпийн өөрчлөлтийн түүх (20261011001) ─────
/// Append-only (app_user: SELECT, INSERT). FK (tenant, actor → core_users; tenant, camp → camps) нь DB-д;
/// Prisma relation-гүй — хуучин model-уудыг өөрчлөхгүйн тулд (зөвхөн нэмэлт).
model CampAuditLog {
  id            String          @id @default(dbgenerated("uuid_generate_v7()")) @db.Uuid
  tenantId      String          @map("tenant_id") @db.Uuid
  campId        String?         @map("camp_id") @db.Uuid
  entityType    String          @map("entity_type")
  entityId      String          @map("entity_id") @db.Uuid
  action        CampAuditAction
  actorUserId   String          @map("actor_user_id") @db.Uuid
  /// Орчуулгын түлхүүр (жнь audit.employee.update) + параметр
  summaryKey    String          @map("summary_key")
  summaryParams Json            @default("{}") @map("summary_params")
  /// { талбар: { from, to } }
  diff          Json            @default("{}")
  importId      String?         @map("import_id") @db.Uuid
  createdAt     DateTime        @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz

  @@index([tenantId, entityType, entityId, createdAt(sort: Desc), id(sort: Desc)], map: "idx_camp_audit_entity")
  @@index([tenantId, campId, createdAt(sort: Desc), id(sort: Desc)], map: "idx_camp_audit_camp")
  @@map("camp_audit_log")
}

// ── v0.2.0 §0.5 — Мастер өгөгдлийн импорт (20261011002) ─────
/// Ажилтан/хэлтэс: PREVIEW → CONFIRMED | CANCELLED. FK (camp, uploaded_by, confirmed_by) нь DB-д; Prisma relation-гүй.
model CampDataImport {
  id            String               @id @default(dbgenerated("uuid_generate_v7()")) @db.Uuid
  tenantId      String               @map("tenant_id") @db.Uuid
  campId        String               @map("camp_id") @db.Uuid
  type          CampDataImportType
  source        CampDataImportSource
  fileName      String?              @map("file_name")
  status        CampDataImportStatus @default(PREVIEW)
  totalRows     Int                  @default(0) @map("total_rows")
  createRows    Int                  @default(0) @map("create_rows")
  updateRows    Int                  @default(0) @map("update_rows")
  unchangedRows Int                  @default(0) @map("unchanged_rows")
  errorRows     Int                  @default(0) @map("error_rows")
  /// [{ row, values, errors: [{ column, code, params }] }]
  parsedRows    Json                 @default("[]") @map("parsed_rows")
  uploadedBy    String               @map("uploaded_by") @db.Uuid
  confirmedBy   String?              @map("confirmed_by") @db.Uuid
  confirmedAt   DateTime?            @map("confirmed_at") @db.Timestamptz
  createdAt     DateTime             @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz
  updatedAt     DateTime             @updatedAt @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz

  @@index([tenantId, campId, createdAt(sort: Desc), id(sort: Desc)], map: "idx_camp_data_imports_cursor")
  @@map("camp_data_imports")
}

/// v0.2.2 Блок 5 (20261017003, PIL-03, D-08) — ажилтны хувийн мэдээлэл (профайл) үзсэн лог. Зөвхөн нэмэх (app_user: SELECT, INSERT).
model CampPiiAccessLog {
  id           String   @id @default(dbgenerated("uuid_generate_v7()")) @db.Uuid
  tenantId     String   @map("tenant_id") @db.Uuid
  viewerUserId String   @map("viewer_user_id") @db.Uuid
  employeeId   String   @map("employee_id") @db.Uuid
  /// 'profile'
  context      String
  viewedAt     DateTime @default(now()) @map("viewed_at") @db.Timestamptz

  viewer   CoreUser   @relation("CampPiiViewer", fields: [tenantId, viewerUserId], references: [tenantId, id], onDelete: Cascade, onUpdate: NoAction, map: "fk_camp_pii_viewer")
  employee HrEmployee @relation(fields: [tenantId, employeeId], references: [tenantId, id], onDelete: Cascade, onUpdate: NoAction, map: "fk_camp_pii_employee")

  @@index([tenantId, employeeId, viewedAt(sort: Desc)], map: "idx_camp_pii_access_employee")
  @@index([tenantId, viewerUserId, employeeId, viewedAt(sort: Desc)], map: "idx_camp_pii_access_viewer")
  @@map("camp_pii_access_log")
}
